nty"],["ARC or PLC in Horry County","/arc-plc/south-carolina/horry-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2026 so far, March to April sat at 18% of normal on the middle of the grids, and April to May at 47% in 2026. Grid 16405 had its driest year in 2007 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
